{
  "identifier": "bkt_ChargeGuard_Mission2_1_start",
  "contents": [
    {
      "words": "Commander, this mission should be right up your ally, as simple as the concept is. Attack, destroy the facility and the McCrimmon's Light Cavalry company that is covering the it. Understood? I have Lieutenant Boyer's lance inbound to assist and keep an eye on you.",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_Davion_Herbert_Hobaugh",
      "emote": "Default",
      "audioName": "NONE",
      "cameraFocusGuid": "",
      "cameraDistance": "Far",
      "cameraHeight": "Default",
      "revealRadius": -1
    },
    {
      "words": "I think we can cover that, Marshall. Landing now.",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
      "emote": "Default",
      "audioName": "NONE",
      "cameraFocusGuid": "",
      "cameraDistance": "Far",
      "cameraHeight": "Default",
      "revealRadius": -1
    },
    {
      "words": "Honestly Commander, sometimes I think Marshal Hobaugh believes we are incapable of even feeding ourselves, no matter what he says about our performance.",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
      "emote": "Default",
      "audioName": "NONE",
      "cameraFocusGuid": "",
      "cameraDistance": "Far",
      "cameraHeight": "Default",
      "revealRadius": -1
    },
    {
      "words": "You will not speak of the Marshal in such a way, unless you wish to be reported and have your contract voided!",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_Davion_Boyar_Christophoros",
      "emote": "Default",
      "audioName": "NONE",
      "cameraFocusGuid": "",
      "cameraDistance": "Far",
      "cameraHeight": "Default",
      "revealRadius": -1
    },
    {
      "words": "Noted, Lieutenant. Is your Lance down and ready for action?",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
      "emote": "Default",
      "audioName": "NONE",
      "cameraFocusGuid": "",
      "cameraDistance": "Far",
      "cameraHeight": "Default",
      "revealRadius": -1
    },
    {
      "words": "A Guards Lance is always ready for action! Besides, it is not as if we really need your 'Mechs. You can watch real MechWarriors go to work if you like?",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_Davion_Boyar_Christophoros",
